{"id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-propositional-tautology.md","title":"Propositional Tautologies of the Modal Language","display":"df-propositional-tautology — Propositional Tautologies of the Modal Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-propositional-tautology","aliases":["89-df-propositional-tautology"],"display":"df-propositional-tautology — Propositional Tautologies of the Modal Language","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-propositional-tautology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-propositional-tautology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-propositional-tautology — Propositional Tautologies of the Modal Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> carries the usual Boolean operations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}=\\mathbf2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}=\\mathbf2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}}\\)</span> 是下述定义的命题原子载体与二值赋值集；递归子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat v:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\widehat v:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span> 为其扩张。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}tautology}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\n\\{\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}},\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\n&amp;\\widehat v(a)&amp;\\coloneqq v(a)\n&amp;&amp; (a\\in\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\widehat v(A),\n&amp;\\widehat v(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\widehat v(A)\\widehat v(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\\;\\widehat v(A)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}tautology}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\n\\{\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}},\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\n&amp;\\widehat v(a)&amp;\\coloneqq v(a)\n&amp;&amp; (a\\in\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\widehat v(A),\n&amp;\\widehat v(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\widehat v(A)\\widehat v(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\\;\\widehat v(A)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\\)</span>, the displayed clauses uniquely\nextend <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> to formulas by structural recursion; a boxed formula is\ntreated as one propositional atom.</li>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\)</span> is exactly the set of substitution instances\nof classical propositional tautologies in the modal language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n[[89-df-modal-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf 2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}=\\mathbf2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat v:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}tautology}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\n&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\n\\{\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\n&\\coloneqq\\mathbf 2^{\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}},\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\bot)&\\coloneqq0,\n&\\widehat v(a)&\\coloneqq v(a)\n&& (a\\in\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\widehat v(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq1-\\widehat v(A),\n&\\widehat v(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\n\\widehat v(A)\\widehat v(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\n&\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}\\;\\widehat v(A)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Val}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}","display":false}],"bytes":1720,"backlinks":[{"id":"d306b38c7e186f86","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the modal-language\npropositional-tautology set from [[89-df-propositional-tautology]]."},{"id":"80c765fb7376d531","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-propositional-tautology]],\n[[89-df-k-axiom]], and [[89-df-lob-axiom]])."},{"id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is defined in\n[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]."},{"id":"db8da4f25311c498","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"12a315bba5062a88","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}